---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site.config';
import { withBase } from '../../utils/withBase';
---

<BaseLayout title="Summer 6&#8217;s &#8212; Metford Cobras FC" description="Summer 6's is happening at Metford Cobras FC. Full details will be posted on our website and socials soon.">
	<section class="container-page py-10 md:py-14 max-w-2xl">
		<p class="kicker">Summer Football</p>
		<h1 class="page-title">Summer 6&#8217;s is happening!</h1>

		<div class="mt-6 card bg-cobra-blue/5 ring-0">
			<p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
				Wow &#8212; we&#8217;ve been absolutely inundated with enquiries about Summer 6&#8217;s, to the point where it&#8217;s
				broken our inbox! Thank you for the incredible response.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
				Needless to say, <strong class="text-slate-900">we will be running a summer competition this year</strong>. We&#8217;re
				working through the details and will post everything &#8212; dates, format, and how to register &#8212; on our
				website and socials as soon as it&#8217;s finalised.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
				Thanks for your patience, and stay tuned!
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
			<a class="btn-primary" href={SITE.facebookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow us on Facebook &#8594;</a>
			<a class="btn-secondary" href={withBase('/subscribe')}>Subscribe for updates &#8594;</a>
		</div>

		<p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
			<a class="text-cobra-blue hover:underline" href={withBase('/play-football/summer')}>Back to Summer Football</a>
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
